"Jon runs a triathlon. It takes him 40 minutes for the swim, an hour and 20 minutes for the bike ride and 50 minutes for the flurf. Compared to Jon, James finishes the swim 10% faster but takes 5 minutes longer on the bike. If Jon won by 10 minutes, how long did it take James to do the flurf?","Jon runs a triathlon. It takes him 40 minutes for the swim, an hour and 20 minutes for the bike ride and 50 minutes for the run. Compared to Jon, James finishes the swim 10% faster but takes 5 minutes longer on the bike. If Jon won by 10 minutes, how long did it take James to do the run?",59,59,59,59,"- Jon’s times: swim 40 min, bike 80 min, flurf 50 min. Total = 40 + 80 + 50 = 170 min.
